  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS GRANT LITTLE BIRD HOTLINE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme provides free legal consultation, aid and mental health counselling for migrant workers who would often be harmed by potential labour right infringements due to lack of knowledge, or merely unnecessary fear of the procedure. Especially after the CoVID-19 outbreak, many migrant workers are being unfairly treated and have had psychological pressure. The Programme aims to stress both the mental and physical wellness of migrant workers.</narrative>
  </description>
